{"name":"Deep Greige","hex":"#726a6e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deep","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Extending, reaching or positioned far from a point of reference, especially downwards.\nExtending far down from the top, or surface, to the bottom, literally or figuratively.","Extending far down from the top, or surface, to the bottom, literally or figuratively."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Far, especially far down through something or into something, physically or figuratively.","In a profound, not superficial, manner."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deep"},{"term":"greige","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of clothing, textiles, etc.: neither bleached nor dyed, nor otherwise fully processed; unfinished.","Of a colour like that of unbleached or undyed fabric, between grey and beige."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour like that of unbleached or undyed fabric between grey and beige, closely akin to taupe.","Clothing, textiles, etc., which have neither been bleached nor dyed, nor otherwise fully processed; greige goods."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greige"}],"entries":[{"title":"Greige goods","blocks":[{"text":"Greige goods are loom state woven fabrics, or unprocessed knitted fabrics. Greige goods undergo many subsequent processes, for instance, dyeing, printing, bleaching, and finishing, prior to further converting to finished goods such as clothing, or other textile products. \"Grey fabrics\" is another term to refer to unfinished woven or knitted fabrics."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Rolls_of_dressed_fibre._Silk_industry_%28spun_silk%29%2C_South_Manchester%2C_Conn.%2C_U.S.A_%28NYPL_b11707678-G90F070_013F%29.tiff/lossy-page1-330px-Rolls_of_dressed_fibre._Silk_industry_%28spun_silk%29%2C_South_Manchester%2C_Conn.%2C_U.S.A_%28NYPL_b11707678-G90F070_013F%29.tiff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=a